      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Muhammad, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Muhammad Bin Ismail Bin Musa Bin Ja’far, and he was the most aged Sheykhs from the children of Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> in Al-Iraq. So he said, ‘I saw him<sup>asws</sup> between the two Masjids and he<sup>asws</sup> was a boy’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          " 2. Ali ibn Muhammad has narrated from Muhammad ibn ’Isma‘il ibn Musa ibn Ja‘far, the most senior (in his time) of the descendants of the Messenger of Allah, in Iraq has said the following. “I saw him (the twelfth Imam (a.s.)) between the two mosque while he was a boy.”"
        ]
      }
